  "html": "<div id=\"question-335464\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">4.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/6377#21666\">Understanding Definitions of Stability Types</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"335464\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Select the correct options in the statement below that describe an <strong>unstable</strong> equilibrium point.</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-335464\" class=\"questionBody\">Some solutions starting\n<div id=\"selectList-335464-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335464-0\" style=\"width: 202px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">arbitrarily close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">arbitrarily close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">at a minimum distance from</div></div></div><div id=\"selectList-335464-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335464-1\" style=\"width: 116px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">the equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">infinity</div></div></div>\neventually\n<div id=\"selectList-335464-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335464-2\" style=\"width: 128px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">move away from</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">move away from</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">reach</div></div></div>\nthe equi